-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=Vinack%27s%20plan%20was%20to,strike%20down%20their%20oracle.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Cowardice of the Hero\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"cowardice-hero-2014-01-22-e7","era":null,"summary":"The narrator searches Zerili's home and ledger and concludes that the village secretly pays human tribute and that Vinack means him to die.","participants":["vinack-s-stepson","zerili","vinack"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"Vinack meant for me to die.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=Vinack%20meant%20for%20me%20to%20die.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Cowardice of the Hero","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-01-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=Vinack%20meant%20for%20me%20to%20die.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Cowardice of the Hero\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"cowardice-hero-2014-01-22-e8","era":null,"summary":"At the minotaur camp the narrator presses a dagger to Vinack's back, and Vinack reveals the sacrifice will be himself.","participants":["vinack-s-stepson","vinack"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":40,"quote":"\"No, Son,\" he said, shaking his head. \"The sacrifice will be me.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=%22No%2C%